SUMMARY:Downy Laundry Scent Beads
DESCRIPTION:Visit Unstopables brand at the Foodie Aisle for samples of Downy Unlimited No. 26 scent booster \n  \nReady to luxe up your laundry? We’re handing out free samples of Downy Unlimited No. 26 scent booster beads in the Foodie Aisle next to MINISO. Crafted by world-class perfumers\, this premium scent blends vibrant Rose\, Honey\, and Oakmoss to give your clothes a sophisticated\, long-lasting fragrance that lasts up to 12 weeks. \n  \nSampling events are independently operated by third-party brands and agencies. The products being distributed\, sample sizes\, quantities\, giveaway limits\, eligibility requirements\, and event operations are determined solely by the participating brand and may change at the brand’s discretion without notice. \n  \nUnion Station does not control\, manage\, or guarantee the type\, size\, quantity\, quality\, or availability of samples provided. Union Station is not responsible for any changes to the products being distributed or the manner in which they are distributed. Any questions\, concerns\, or feedback regarding a sampling event should be directed to the participating brand. \n  \nSampling hours may vary and events may begin later than scheduled\, pause for breaks\, or conclude early once supplies have been exhausted. Guests are not permitted to queue or wait near the kiosk during non-operating periods. \n  \nWe ask all guests to treat staff\, brand representatives\, and fellow visitors with courtesy and respect. Disruptive\, aggressive\, or inappropriate behaviour may result in refusal of service and denial of participation in the sampling event.”
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/union-samples-unstopables/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Samples
