SUMMARY:Air Canada
DESCRIPTION:Air Canada is inviting Canadians to put their travel knowledge to the test in the Oak Room at Union Station by uncovering destination clues and guessing where they’re going next. Participants can scan a QR code to access additional clues and enter for a chance to win a trip to one of the featured destinations. 
